<!DOCTYPE html><html data-dpl-id="dpl_2L2ZQhcgFNrCZrPasPGZZjU2UJvK" lang="en" dir="ltr" class="plus_jakarta_sans_2b9a293f-module__hJ4j6G__variable jetbrains_mono_1a89b578-module__QiOztG__variable noto_sans_arabic_a9dad8e6-module__uxIY-W__variable noto_sans_kr_c9e7d198-module___ZHWhq__variable"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/immutable/media/051742360c26797e-s.p.1wmoa0e_blxrz.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/immutable/media/3fd1b3eda9c5392f-s.p.3ocmk-uw9eanw.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/immutable/media/fba5a26ea33df6a3-s.p.08ssgmy_tb90r.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" href="/_next/static/immutable/media/fca78c2ee6cec166-s.p.3gt5tz96sx5tr.woff2" as="font" crossorigin="" type="font/woff2"/><link rel="preload" as="image" imageSrcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbest-local-models-tool-calling-2026-comparison-hero-en.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L2ZQhcgFNrCZrPasPGZZjU2UJvK 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fbest-local-models-tool-calling-2026-comparison-hero-en.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L2ZQhcgFNrCZrPasPGZZjU2UJvK 2x"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/33l5h8no2jfa0.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2itzredo0knmp.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2tah7n8x2186n.css" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0-wmuzlxi_j26.js"/><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0kutihoc00g7e.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/07bn70_pxtj_z.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0-0xrspzbh795.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/turbopack-0pxymbsmxjwhn.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/298pqgs97c3c-.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/07_s0cj_2a90-.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/065uwlsuv6sgb.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3tpge21fuyqsa.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/11jgv3gtkcgxt.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/38_5i1rr0w_u3.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0lu-42685i5g1.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><link rel="preload" href="/lib/s/script.js" as="script"/><meta name="next-size-adjust" content=""/><meta name="theme-color" content="#6750A4"/><link rel="preconnect" href="https://img.youtube.com"/><link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://img.youtube.com"/><link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://cdn.onesignal.com"/><link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com"/><link rel="mcp" href="/mcp.json" type="application/json"/><link rel="alternate" type="text/plain" href="/llms.txt"/><link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="PromptQuorum Blog" href="/feed.xml"/><title>Best Local Tool-Calling Models 2026: Real MCP Benchmarks</title><meta name="description" content="Compare Gemma 4 27B, GLM-4.7 32B, Qwen3 32B, Qwen3-Coder 30B, and Llama 3.3 70B for tool-calling reliability. Real MCP benchmarks, not leaderboard scores."/><meta name="author" content="Hans Kuepper"/><meta name="robots" content="index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1"/><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.promptquorum.com/power-local-llm/best-local-models-tool-calling-2026"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="en" href="https://www.promptquorum.com/power-local-llm/best-local-models-tool-calling-2026"/><link rel="alternate" hrefLang="de"